  "notes": "Measured on A321neos (2025); A320s/A321ceos wear the same. Wizz Air Malta (9H-) and Wizz Air UK (G-) aircraft wear it unchanged. Where the magenta begins under the wing is hidden in the photos; the belly is only glimpsed (blurred) on approach. Re-checked 2026-11-15 on 9H-WDS (A321neo, side-on): 'wizz' and the aft 'wizzair.com' given measured lengths; the belly title has no photo that shows it clearly enough to measure its length.",
  "history": "Replaced Skyarium v1's approximation. The 2015 scheme replaced Wizz's earlier white aircraft with a purple fin and magenta 'wizzair.com' titles."
